    "media:imagetext": "kaiseki style meal\nappetiser\nshrimp with sea urchin paste, herring roe, fish cake,\nrolled egg with crab meat, braised black bean in radish cup\nfish cake with sea urchin soup\ncold dish\nhalibut with sea kelp flavor, tuna roll with seaweed\nmain course\n\"kaisen nabe\"\npickle vegetables, miso soup\nsteamed rice\nplum wine, cool sake and green tea are available\nik # cuisine\nappetiser\nabalone rose, deep-fried prawn, pan-fried mousse de foie gras, braised kohlrabi\npickle dish\nsoup\nchicken with scallop and winter bamboo soup\nshin yeh salad\nmain course\nbraised pork with seaweed, steamed lobster with garlic\nstir-fried bamboo fungus, steamed rice\npacific-rim trendsetter\nappetiser\ncrab meat salad with persimmon, prosciutto with cream cheese\npacific seafood chowder\nsalad\ngarden salad\nthousand island dressing, shin yeh dressing, shiso dressing\nmain course\ngrilled lamb chop with rosemary glazed sauce\ncheese selection and seasonal fresh fruit\nes\nstrawberry and orange mousse\nOr\nhäagen-dazs ice cream\n93D-CI05/DL9873GI0//DL9875/VN9917-3\nclassic breakfast\nfresh fruit of the season\nmuesli and yoghurt drink\nscrambled egg wrapped in crepe with chicken sausage\nOr\nmushroom omelette with grilled canadian bacon\nchinese breakfast\nfresh fruit of season\ntraditional congee with delicatessen\nor\nbraised beef noodle soup\n* exclusive for china airlines *\njasmine tea\ntekuanyin tea\noolong tea\ncontinental breakfast\nfresh fruit of the season\nmuesli and yoghurt drink\nbread basket with butter or preserves\ncoffee tea\nmilk juice\n93D-CI05/DL9873/CI07/DL9875/VN991F-4",
